      en: ["The factories are located near the Northern Longitudinal Highway.", "Chalatenango is historically famous for indigo (añil) cultivation.", "Textiles constitute a significant portion of exports from the region.", "The region often utilizes hydroelectric power from nearby dams.", "Factories offer specialized training in weaving techniques.", "Chalatenango is situated at an average altitude of 450 meters."],
