      en: ["Primary hub for international Business Process Outsourcing (BPO).", "Hosts numerous high-capacity call centers serving the North American market.", "Features the highest density of fiber-optic connectivity in the metro area.", "The nation's most significant site for IT services and software engineering.", "Provides modern coworking environments for emerging technology startups.", "Heavy operational focus on bilingual (Spanish/English) service delivery."],
