      en: ["Strategic hub located along the vital Troncal del Norte trade route.", "Center for the production of galvanized steel and industrial metalware.", "Hosts major milling facilities for the large-scale production of corn flour.", "Key site for plastics recycling and specialized chemical processing.", "Headquarters for several of the region's largest transport firms.", "Features extensive warehousing facilities supporting cross-border trade."],
