      en: ["Located within the municipality of Acajutla, Sonsonate department.", "Famous for sea salt production in extensive artisanal salt pans.", "A key location for the artisanal harvesting of crustaceans and shellfish.", "The coastline features strong surf and wide, sandy beaches.", "Economically integrated with the central fish market in Sonsonate.", "Historically served as a transit point for indigo dye exports in the 19th century."],
